// spec: 3, 7
// `size` in `style boundary` is an `attr` error, as is a number; a size must be positive. A
// group with no size, or an `auto` axis from its style, fits its children, so an empty one has
// no size to fit.
diagram "style size errors" size (500,300)
style boundary { size=(100,100) }
style big { size=12 }
style flat { size=(0,10) }
style fit { size=(auto, 40) }
group g at (10,10) style=fit {
}
group k at (200,10) {
}
box a "A" at (10,200) style=big
